  "label": "Parents who adhere to punitive parenting ideologies",
  "description": "The meme targets parents who believe in or are influenced by punitive parenting ideologies that equate physical punishment (spanking) with effective child-rearing. It attempts to instill fear and guilt in these parents by suggesting that not spanking leads to catastrophic outcomes, thereby reinforcing their belief system or pushing them toward adopting spanking as a parenting tool.",
